<view class="page"><view class="kicker">当前成品 V{{product.versionNumber||1}}</view><view class="title">提出修改要求</view><view class="muted">可以添加多条意见，每条填写时间点和调整内容。</view><view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="index" class="card"><view class="label">意见 {{index+1}}</view><input class="input" placeholder="时间点，例如 00:18" value="{{item.timecode}}" data-i="{{index}}" data-k="timecode" bindinput="change"/><textarea class="textarea" placeholder="请输入修改内容" value="{{item.message}}" data-i="{{index}}" data-k="message" bindinput="change"></textarea><button wx:if="{{items.length>1}}" size="mini" data-i="{{index}}" bindtap="remove">删除此条</button></view><button class="secondary" bindtap="add">添加一条意见</button><view class="tip">提交后剪辑师会逐条处理，旧版本和历史意见都会保留。</view><button class="primary submit" bindtap="submit">提交修改意见</button></view>
